{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Script-rolled proc talents keep spell_proc.Chance 100",
  "contract": "Every listed aura rolls its own proc chance in its AuraScript CheckProc. Its effective SpellProcEntry Chance, after SpellMgr::LoadSpellProcs fills a zero Chance from the DBC ProcChance, must stay 100 so the native roll in Aura::GetProcEffectMask cannot square it (rev_20260919_20 regression, #4275). proc-chance-script-rolled-rates-4275.json measures the resulting rates.",
